# hunter-open — DEFAULT. The most de-restricted model that fits on this card.
#
# Josiefied-Qwen3-8B-abliterated-v1: abliterated AND then finetuned for openness and
# instruction-following. The double treatment is why it sits above a plain abliterated
# model on compliance -- abliteration alone leaves refusals surviving in some phrasings.
#
# NOTE: there is deliberately NO SYSTEM block here.
#
# The JOSIEFIED models ship their own system prompt, tuned as part of the openness
# finetune. Overriding it with a generic one measurably weakens compliance -- the prompt
# is part of the product. Omitting SYSTEM makes Ollama inherit the base model's.
# Do not "improve" this by adding one.
#
# 5.0 GB of weights against a ~5.2 GB budget: knife edge. Requires
# OLLAMA_KV_CACHE_TYPE=q8_0 and this small context. Check `ollama ps` says 100% GPU.

FROM goekdenizguelmez/JOSIEFIED-Qwen3:8b-q4_k_m

PARAMETER num_ctx 4096
PARAMETER temperature 0.7
PARAMETER top_p 0.9
PARAMETER top_k 40
PARAMETER repeat_penalty 1.1
